'''Incubator''' (インキュベーター, ''Inkyubētā'', '''Incubator''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Incubator
|image = E 579.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
Incubator is essentially a stronger version of [[Kang Roo]] with lower health and movement speed, more knockbacks, and less attack power, along with less range and a Level 2 [[Wave Attack]].

==Strategy==
Due to Incubator's Single Target and low range, it is recommended you use [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] paired with ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to take down Incubator. Its [[Wave Attack]] is nothing special due to the 200 damage.

